; XAUUSD FTMO Confluence EA - EXIT STRUCTURE Exit_A_Scaled
;
; Scaled exit, retuned. 40% off at 1R, runner to 2.2R, trail engages right after the partial so the runner is not left sitting at breakeven.
;
; Single run, not an optimisation. Run all three Exit_* files over the
; same period and compare profit factor and the payoff ratio (avg win
; divided by avg loss). The payoff is the number that was broken:
; the backtest delivered 0.50 where roughly 1.6 is needed at a 46%
; win rate.
;
